.SS "\fBPlanet\fP * initPlanet ()"

.PP
Initializes a planetwith random amounts of ressources, within playable parameters\&. Playable parameters include :
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBPlanet\fP radius must be at least 100km
.IP "\(bu" 2
Population must be at least 2 to allow reproduction\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Water, Minerals and Wood at total must be at least the amount of starting population\&. 
.PP

.SS "void runFullGame ()"

.PP
Runs the full game, turn by turn, until win condition or game over is reached\&. This function will initialize everything to a playable state, before launching the game loop, once the loop stops it will handle memory deallocation as well\&. 
